<title>USA: RESEARCH ALERT - Tiffany upgraded to buy.</title>
<headline>RESEARCH ALERT - Tiffany upgraded to buy.</headline>
<dateline>NEW YORK 1997-08-19</dateline>
<text>
<p>Prudential Securities raised its rating on shares of Tiffany &amp; Co Inc to buy from hold, a source at the brokerage firm said Tuesday.</p>
<p>-- Further details were not immediately available.</p>
<p>-- The company reported second-quarter earnings of $0.29 per share, up from $0.24 per share in the same period a year ago.</p>
<p>-- Shares rose 2-9/16 to 43-5/16.</p>
<p>((Wall Street desk))</p>
</text>
